\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Real Opens At BRR2.690/Dlr Vs BRR2.671 End Fri \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2001\par 14:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- Brazil's real opened under pressure Monday, reflecting continuing worries about the global economic outlook and reduced foreign investment flows into emerging markets. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened 1.9 centavo weaker at BRR2.690 to the dollar, as investors fret over possible imminent U.S. military reprisal against terrorist networks. The real closed slightly stronger at BRR2.671 Friday, following a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The outlook is very uncertain and demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedge remains strong," said a Sao Paulo-based trader. \par \par \uc2  In addition to reduced foreign capital inflows, one key factor sending the real weaker in recent weeks has been large corporate demand for dollars to protect their balance sheets from \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses. \par \par \uc2  Even though the market regulator has allowed companies to defer \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses over the next four years, traders said many firms continue to sell reals and buy dollars to avoid running any \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks going forward. \par \par \uc2  The real has lost nearly 30% of its value this year to date, despite massive \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain the depreciation. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday said it was drawing down a $4.7 billion aid tranche by the International Monetary Fund as part of a recently-inked $15.5 billion package. The move aims to boost the country's hard-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and try to calm investors at a time when the real is under added pressure. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11 3145-1481; adriana.arai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011001dxa1000pz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
