\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Fraga: \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Via Futures Not Discarded \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2001\par 20:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Arminio Fraga said Monday the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't ruled the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by means of derivatives in the future, the local Estado news agency said. \par \par \uc2  Currently Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can't use derivatives such as futures contracts for \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  because of a restriction imposed by the International Monetary Fund as part of a $41.5 billion aid package. This IMF agreement expires at the end of this year. \par \par \uc2  "I don't discard the possibility of, in the long term, having adjustments (to the current rules), but we don't have any plans in the sense at the moment," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The bank has been relying on the sale of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or dollar-indexed bonds on the spot market whenever it feels it has to prop up the value of the real against the greenback. \par \par \uc2  Faced with the dramatic weakening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unveiled a package of measures Thursday aimed at containing the real's depreciation. Fraga said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would boost reserves and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market whenever deemed necessary. \par \par \uc2  The measures follow a 150-basis-point hike in the country's basic interest rate to 18.25% late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The combined actions helped the real move to around BRR2.30 to the dollar from BRR2.47. \par \par \uc2  By Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11 3145-1481 adriana.arai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx6p02w45\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
