ight\uc2  rose as high as 2.391 per dollar from Wednesday's close of 2.468, but then rolled back slightly to 1.415. It had opened already stronger after Wednesday night's surprisingly steep hike of a key interest rate by 150 basis points to 18.25 percent. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised it to combat the inflationary pressures of the weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6l0101d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
