\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2-Brazil mounts offensive to prop up mauled  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mary Milliken \par \uc2 832 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 2001\par 00:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  (updates with closing prices, Cenbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed, inflation goals) \par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , June 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  unleashed an arsenal of measures on Thursday to shore up the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and the embattled local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after neighboring Argentina's financial crisis this week pushed the real to all-time lows. \par \par \uc2  The morning after Brazil shocked markets with a bold 1.5 percentage point increase in the key Selic interest rate to 18.25 percent, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Arminio Fraga surprised them again with news that Brazil would draw down $2 billion from an International Monetary Fund credit line next week. \par \par \uc2  The IMF money - to be drawn from a $41 billion package assembled for Brazil during the country's last \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in late 1998 - will be part of a war chest of $10.8 billion announced by Fraga to bolster reserves and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also confirmed it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday - the second time this week - by selling dollars for reais. The bank would not reveal how much it spent, but Fraga earlier told reporters that $445 million was employed in Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real soared on Fraga's strategy, recovering 3.5 percent to close at 2.381 reais per dollar from 2.47 on Wednesday, but is still 22 percent weaker so far this year. \par \par \uc2  "You can see the positive impact of the comments in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market today," said Mario Mesquita, chief economist at ABN Amro in Brazil. "The tendency over the next few weeks will be for the dollar to fall even more." \par \par \uc2  The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange's benchmark Bovespa stock index also gained ground on the measures, closing 1.7 percent higher. \par \par \uc2  Fraga stressed that the pressure on the real was temporary and the country was making no changes to its exchange regime, a free-floating system adopted in 1999 which paved the way for a sharp devaluation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  followed by a period of relative stability. \par \par \uc2  "Our destiny is not to live crisis after crisis after crisis," Fraga told reporters. " \par \par \uc2  HOW GREEN WAS BRAZIL'S VALLEY \par \par \uc2  Two years after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, Latin America's largest country kicked off the year with a sound economy set to grow 4 percent for the second consecutive year while inflation was forecast at a low 4 percent. \par \par \uc2  The only dark cloud was in neighboring Argentina, the key Brazilian trading partner, that was struggling after nearly three years of recession and investor fears of a debt default. \par \par \uc2  But the lack of progress in reviving the Argentine economy has spilled over to Brazil and investors sold reais in favor of safe-haven U.S. dollars. \par \par \uc2  A string of corruption scandals in the highest levels of Congress and the surprise announcement of energy rationing a month ago further undermined investment and growth prospects for the year. \par \par \uc2  The real had lost more than 25 percent of its value against the dollar and hit an all-time low of 2.48 Tuesday after Argentina tinkered with its decade-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg to spur exports, a move many saw as a hint of a devaluation in the works. \par \par \uc2  "There's no sense in crying over spilled milk," Fraga said. "The important thing is to react and that's what we're doing. \par \par \uc2  Of the total planned war chest of $10.8 billion, Fraga said $6.2 billion would be channeled into reserves while the remaining $4.6 billion could used to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market. \par \par \uc2  In addition to the $2 billion to be drawn from the IMF, Brazil has decided to defer a $1.8 billion loan payment to the IMF it had planned to pay ahead of schedule this year. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said the changes do not mean Brazil will extend its three-year loan accord with the IMF, which expires at the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  He said Brazil would also secure $1.8 billion from international lending agencies and issue $1 billion more in international bonds than originally planned, bringing the total for the year to $7 billion. \par \par \uc2  The total also included a $400 million bond already issued by the BNDES, the National Development Bank. The remaining $3.8 billion will come from sales of stock in publicly-owned companies. \par \par \uc2  Fraga also said inflation goals of 4 percent for 2001 and 3.5 percent for 2002, plus or minus two percentage points, remained intact. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's inflation risks are relatively mild compared to the days of hyperinflation in the early 1990s, when prices spiraled up by 7,000 percent a year. But interest rates can only come down if Brazil meets its inflation goals, threatened by higher import prices as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakens. \par \par \uc2  With higher rates and electricity rationing for the next six months, Brazil's economy is likely to grow by only 2 to 2.5 percent rather than 4 percent this year, economists say. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6l00zmd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
