ic interest rate to 18.25% late Wednesday, caused the real to strengthen from its closing level Wednesday of BRR2.468. \par \par \uc2  The real has lost about 21% of its value this year and driven up inflation amid worries about Argentina, as well as a 20% power rationing program and cracks in Brazil's five-party coalition government. \par \par \uc2  -By Terry Wade, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511.3145.1479; terry.wade@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010711dx6l00229\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
