\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real -2: Ctrl Bk Later Confirms  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 342 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2001\par 23:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones News Service \par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  Later, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market by directly selling dollars to investors but didn't disclose the amount. \par \par \uc2  Even though investors are growing confident that troubled neighbor Argentina's plan to swap short-term debt for long-term bonds will go forward, the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reacting to homegrown problems such as the energy crunch and political turbulence. \par \par \uc2  Economists have cut their growth forecast for Brazil to below 3% from 4% to 4.5% after the government unveiled a rationing plan that calls for a 20% reduction in electricity use during at least six months, beginning in June. \par \par \uc2  BBV Banco's Barros said it is still unclear how big will be the overall impact of the energy crisis on the country's balance of payments, noting nonetheless that foreign direct investment will certainly fall. \par \par \uc2  "Right now we have a $19 billion foreign direct investment forecast for 2001, but this is an optimistic scenario and we maybe have to revise it downward in the future," he said. His real estimate is BRR2.30 to the dollar by year end. \par \par \uc2  Brazil received $6.76 billion in foreign investment in production of goods and services locally between January and April, while the country's current account deficit was $8.33 billion in the period. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had a $24 billion forecast for FDI in 2001 but said it is currently revising its estimates. \par \par \uc2  The energy crisis is also widely expected to hit Brazilian President Fernando Henrique Cardoso's popularity hard, reducing the chances that he will be able to elect a nominated successor in the 2002 presidential elections. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the bank said Brazilian international reserves inched lower to $35.731 billion Thursday from $35.730 billion Wednesday. Daily reserve figures are available at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Internet site with a one-day lag. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcb.gov.br/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bcb.gov.br}}}\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511-3813-1988; adriana.arai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dj00000020010711dx5p03v42\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
