\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real -3: No Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Reported \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 2001\par 22:54\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  Despite the sharp weakening from Thursday's close of BRR2.154 to the dollar, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't make any attempts to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sometimes calls the main banks' trading desks to show that it's worried about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "That would have been an attempt to try to fix the unfixable," said a trader, who criticized the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to sell longer-dated dollar-indexed bonds this week. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold 55-month dollar-pegged bonds with a total face value of BRR750 million at an average yield of 11.20%. This is higher than the previous sale of the same bond maturity, which was at 10.87%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is scheduled to sell another BRR1.55 billion batch of dollar-indexed bonds due April 2003 on Tuesday. The Monday and Tuesday sales should be enough to roll over all dollar-indexed coming due later this week. \par \par \uc2  The Argentine concerns built on an already nervous market, with a key decision on rates expected Wednesday and corruption allegations surfacing against the head of the Senate over the weekend. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Brazilian international reserves edged higher to $35.696 billion Thursday from $35.686 billion Wednesday. Daily reserve figures are available at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Internet site, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcb.gov.br/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bcb.gov.br}}}\uc2  with a one-day lag. Friday was a national holiday. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Arai, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511-3813-1988; adriana.arai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010711dx4g0036m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
